				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "290f95c3-9f11-507d-b269-214b3ff1bc52"))
	(text "EN low: shutdown with load disconnect (no path from VIN to VOUT), about 0.1 uA from the cells."
